{"id":"b1fb54208bb3eb6c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-lachlan-nonsplit.md","title":"原 non-splitting 断言的否定","display":"thm-lachlan-nonsplit — 原 non-splitting 断言的否定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-lachlan-nonsplit","aliases":["20-thm-lachlan-nonsplit"],"display":"thm-lachlan-nonsplit — 原 non-splitting 断言的否定","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"corrected-counterexample","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.3；原错误断言的反证","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-lachlan-nonsplit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-lachlan-nonsplit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lachlan-nonsplit — 原 non-splitting 断言的否定"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"corrected-counterexample"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.3；原错误断言的反证"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>旧稿断言有非零 c.e. 度不能写成两个非零严格下度的 join。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}nonsplit}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a_i&lt;\\mathbf b\\ (i&lt;2)\\land\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1=\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}nonsplit}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a_i&lt;\\mathbf b\\ (i&lt;2)\\land\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1=\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Sacks 的不可比分裂给出每个非零 c.e. 度的反证。真实 Lachlan non-splitting 结果需要其他区间和分裂限制，旧稿无法确定其意图；不把此错误断言恢复为有效定理。本原子保留文件标识，提供已核实否定；真实 named result 的重新建模列入待办。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.3；原错误断言的反证；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ambos-split]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lachlan\\text{-}nonsplit}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\\n\\exists\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf0<\\mathbf a_i<\\mathbf b\\ (i<2)\\land\\mathbf a_0\\vee\\mathbf a_1=\\mathbf b].","display":true}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["1013cc25d82f1ed8","f389bdba28de0478"]}